  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>An addon for overt armor systems, designed to catch shrapnel and dampen concussive blasts.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Armor Attachment. May only be installed into SP15 or higher Body Armor.</strong> Installing this requires a DV17 Basic Tech Skill Check, and cannot be removed once installed. Wearers of the armor now cannot suffer Critical Injuries caused by Explosives, and Explosive Ammunition used against them does not treat 5s as 6s for the purposes of incurring Critical Injuries.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to Infernox_Ratchet for the basis and initial creation of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Armor Attachment (Body Armor, SP 15+)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armor Enhancement rules: one Enhancement per piece of armor (armor worn on both body and head counts as one piece); not for cyberware armor (Skinweave, Subdermal Armor) or armor that's part of an ACPA or vehicle; SP limits use the armor's fully repaired SP; a Tech installs or removes one in 1 hour with no check; they don't count as Tech Upgrades for Upgrade Expertise. Armor Attachments have no limit per armor unless stated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Enhancements &amp; Kits).</em></p>"
